From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] appxpackaging: Block map readers and device capabilities (6055)

IAppxPackageReader::GetBlockMap, IAppxBundleReader::GetBlockMap,
IAppxFactory::CreateBlockMapReader and CreateValidatedBlockMapReader, and
IAppxManifestReader::GetDeviceCapabilities gave E_NOTIMPL. Package tools
and installers read a package's block map to check its files, and its
device capabilities to show what it uses.

The block map interfaces (IAppxBlockMapReader, IAppxBlockMapFile,
IAppxBlockMapBlock and their enumerators) and
IAppxManifestDeviceCapabilitiesEnumerator are declared in
appxpackaging.idl. New blockmap.c reads AppxBlockMap.xml: its files with
their sizes and local file header sizes, their blocks' hashes and
compressed sizes, the hash method URI and the XML itself;
ValidateFileHash checks a stream against a file's blocks. A validated
reader also checks the block map's digest in the package signature
(AppxSignature.p7x) and that signature. The manifest reader keeps its
DeviceCapability names.
---
diff --git a/dlls/appxpackaging/Makefile.in b/dlls/appxpackaging/Makefile.in
index 613db3a..4f3bdcb 100644
--- a/dlls/appxpackaging/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/appxpackaging/Makefile.in
@@ -1,8 +1,9 @@
 MODULE    = appxpackaging.dll
-IMPORTS   = $(ZLIB_PE_LIBS) uuid ole32 oleaut32 xmllite bcrypt
+IMPORTS   = $(ZLIB_PE_LIBS) uuid ole32 oleaut32 xmllite bcrypt crypt32 urlmon
 EXTRAINCL = $(ZLIB_PE_CFLAGS)
 
 SOURCES = \
+	blockmap.c \
 	classes.idl \
 	main.c \
 	manifest.c \
diff --git a/dlls/appxpackaging/blockmap.c b/dlls/appxpackaging/blockmap.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..889f37e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/appxpackaging/blockmap.c
@@ -0,0 +1,851 @@
